  people throughout the evening. There's no need to figure out who to appro
 ach or how to get started — just join in\, enjoy the conversations and s
 ee who you connect with.\n\\*\\*✨ Festive & Themed Connection Rounds\\*\
 \*\nWe'll bring in interactive prompts and themed conversation challenges 
